She is so smart and can be a man.

250
00:21:52,166 --> 00:21:52,996
The girl is home and has a man.

251
00:21:53,079 --> 00:21:53,909
These are the four days
a day to stay alive.

252
00:21:53,992 --> 00:21:54,822
Don't forget that they are home.

253
00:21:54,905 --> 00:21:55,735
I have a family and I
don't work here with you.

254
00:21:55,818 --> 00:21:56,648
I have a family, friends
and I have a family.

255
00:21:56,731 --> 00:21:59,920
I love you.

256
00:22:01,660 --> 00:22:03,484
To the people who they love me.

257
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:08,640
You're late, Suguru.

258
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:11,720
Actually, I guess you got here fast.

259
00:22:12,740 --> 00:22:17,034
After all, there are several Star
Religious Group facilities in the city.

260
00:22:18,220 --> 00:22:19,860
Satoru, is that you?

261
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:21,940
What happened?

262
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:25,040
I see you already saw Shoko.

263
00:22:25,940 --> 00:22:27,705
Yeah, she was able to heal me.

264
00:22:28,340 --> 00:22:29,693
I'm feeling fine again.

265
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:36,080
But that doesn't change
anything here, does it?

266
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:38,132
I screwed up pretty bad.

267
00:22:38,380 --> 00:22:40,027
You're not the one at fault.

268
00:22:40,640 --> 00:22:41,680
Let's head back.

269
00:22:43,300 --> 00:22:45,820
Suguru, should we kill these guys?

270
00:22:46,620 --> 00:22:49,561
The way I am right now, I
doubt I'd feel anything.

271
00:22:52,780 --> 00:22:53,610
No.

272
00:22:53,693 --> 00:22:54,523
There's no point.

273
00:22:55,420 --> 00:22:58,361
It looks like they are
only common believers here.

274
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:02,960
The masterminds who know about our
world have probably fled already.

275
00:23:03,620 --> 00:23:08,149
And unlike with the bounty, they won't
be able to talk their way out of this.

276
00:23:08,340 --> 00:23:10,928
The organization had
problems to begin with.

277
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:13,064
It'll be dissolved soon enough.

278
00:23:14,820 --> 00:23:16,100
No point, huh?

279
00:23:16,760 --> 00:23:19,460
Does there really need
to be any point to it?

280
00:23:31,740 --> 00:23:37,300
It's very important that there is,
especially for a Jujutsu Sorcerer.

281
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:42,137
I wonder if whoever
came up with the phrase,

282
00:23:42,220 --> 00:23:44,817
a surprising side, thought
of people as cubes.

283
00:23:44,900 --> 00:23:49,597
And if whoever came up with the insult,
shallow, thought of people as flat surfaces.

284
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:51,440
Next time, premature death.

285
00:23:51,740 --> 00:23:54,622
Either way, people always
have two sides to them.
